# TODO — Defect Classification Stack

## Pending

### TensorRT engine build
`top_models/model_optimized/export_engines.py` (and pipeline step 11) produces
ONNX by default. Building `.engine` files requires TensorRT:

    pip install tensorrt
    .venv/bin/python run_pipeline.py --steps 11 --engine-format engine --engine-half

### Historical metric CSVs reflect old pos_label=1 convention
runs1 / runs2 / runs3 artefacts on disk were produced before the positive-class
bug was fixed. Code is now correct (pos_label=0, defect=positive) but saved
JSON / CSV files have not been re-computed. A `--force` pipeline run writes
corrected numbers.

---

## Completed

- [x] **Orchestration script** — `run_pipeline.py` at repo root runs all 12 steps
      (0 data-prep through 11 engine-export). Skip-if-exists by default,
      `--force` to re-run, `--steps N M ...` for subsets.
- [x] **End-to-end reproducibility** — step 0 builds the balanced dataset from
      `zeroq_cup_classification_scaffold/data/raw/` (balance → split) so a
      clean machine needs no undocumented prep step.
- [x] **YOLO26s aggregation** — `aggregate_results.py` now globs `iter*yolo*`
      and `iter*mlp*`, so runs3 directory names (`iter1_yolo_320`,
      `iter2_yolo_s`, `iter1_mlp_boost`) are picked up alongside runs1/2.
- [x] **YOLO F1 inflation** — aggregator sets F1=None for YOLO rows, keeps
      top1_acc in its own column; manifest.csv follows the same convention.
- [x] **Positive-class ambiguity** — `pos_label=0` (defect=positive) in
      `common.py`, `train_sklearn_baseline.py`, `train_cnn_pretrained.py`,
      `train_keras_mlp_random_search.py`.
- [x] **Broken macOS symlink** — `defect_classification_stack/data` is now a
      relative link to `../zeroq_cup_classification_scaffold/data`.
- [x] **top_models/ folder** — 10 ranked checkpoints as real copied `.pt`
      files (no symlinks), `manifest.csv` with cleanly machine-readable
      columns (numeric stays numeric, no string placeholders), `eval_all.py`,
      `README.md` scoreboard.
- [x] **model_optimized/ folder** — `export_engines.py` handles YOLO→ONNX/TRT
      and PyTorch→ONNX; gracefully skips TRT when not installed.
- [x] **Demo top-6 MobileNet resize** — `demo_live_test_with_video_top6.py`
      now infers training img_size from the checkpoint path (256 for
      fine-tuned runs, 224 for frozen) so inference matches training.
- [x] **Demo top-6 silent model drop** — any extra `--models` beyond the five
      defaults get auto-generated display names from the checkpoint parent
      folder instead of being dropped by `zip()`.
- [x] **README refresh** — Quick Start points at `run_pipeline.py`; per-script
      examples updated to runs3-tuned settings (MLP 24 trials / 96 px, YOLO
      img=320 batch=64 epochs=50).
- [x] **Git hygiene** — `.pt` weights and run outputs (`runs*/`,
      `defect_classification_stack/runs/`) excluded in `.gitignore`; scripts,
      manifests, READMEs still tracked.
